ViridianChannel_Text_FenIntro::
    .string "The bridge shakes when people run.\n"
    .string "The fish always notice first!$"

ViridianChannel_Text_FenDefeat::
    .string "That was quite a splash!$"

ViridianChannel_Text_FenAfter::
    .string "ROUTE 2 is back to the west.\n"
    .string "I like to stop here before\p"
    .string "heading farther from home.$"

ViridianChannel_Text_FenRematch::
    .string "Back across the CHANNEL?\n"
    .string "Let's see what you have learned!$"

ViridianChannel_Text_HarlanIntro::
    .string "I fish from these wide platforms.\n"
    .string "There is room to let others pass!$"

ViridianChannel_Text_HarlanDefeat::
    .string "You reeled that one in!$"

ViridianChannel_Text_HarlanAfter::
    .string "Keep heading east for ROUTE 16.\n"
    .string "Follow the bridges and you can\p"
    .string "cross without entering the water.$"

ViridianChannel_Text_HarlanRematch::
    .string "Another crossing, another battle!$"

ViridianChannel_Text_CoralIntro::
    .string "The water feels different from\n"
    .string "the view up on the bridge!$"

ViridianChannel_Text_CoralDefeat::
    .string "Time to catch my breath!$"

ViridianChannel_Text_CoralAfter::
    .string "The rocks narrow the swimming\n"
    .string "space here. I stay close to\p"
    .string "the crossing when I need a rest.$"

ViridianChannel_Text_CoralRematch::
    .string "Ready for another round\n"
    .string "out on the water?$"
